# Google Maps Platform API Key (used by SvelteKit client Maps JS API via $env/dynamic/public
# and server-side /api/* BFF proxy endpoints).
# NEVER commit a real API key or hardcode it in source files.
#
# Quickstart — Obtain a free zero-billing Maps Demo Key for prototyping:
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with a Google account (no billing card required for the Demo Key).
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms when prompted.
# 4. Click to generate / reveal the demo key, then paste it below in a local .env file.
#
# For production, create and restrict an API key in Google Cloud Console:
# https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Geocoding API, Weather API,
# Air Quality API, Pollen API, and Solar API.
PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
